  ('a037f02f-35f7-452e-87d0-b10ec85ca910', '95d38b90-1d15-4c16-99d3-9cfff27f4036', 'aa22815f-f492-40cb-8cca-0639f02a3791', $q$Nova$q$, $q$2Unfavourable weather conditions$q$, 6, $q$$q$, $q$$q$, $q$2. Invest in battery storage solution. CAPEX increases with 0.3 $ M/MW for fiscal year, OPEX increases with $0.03 M/MW, and capacity factor increases to 32%.$q$, null, null, null, 0.32, null, null, 0, true, null),
  ('60663fe5-0622-4219-afbe-c7ab4c4dab39', '95d38b90-1d15-4c16-99d3-9cfff27f4036', '5df9743e-397a-44ad-953d-a2ab10ea6251', $q$Aquila$q$, $q$2Land_use_conflict$q$, 6, $q$$q$, $q$$q$, $q$2. Offer reduced electricity price. Offtake price reduces to $45/MWh.$q$, null, null, null, 0.42, null, null, 0, true, null),
  ('17c74b48-2abc-4f13-8252-35e50c799e0b', '95d38b90-1d15-4c16-99d3-9cfff27f4036', '5df9743e-397a-44ad-953d-a2ab10ea6251', $q$Aquila$q$, $q$1Land_use_conflict$q$, 6, $q$Aquila Onshore Wind - Land use conflict$q$, $q$<p>The local community are complaining of excess noise from turbines and show concerns regarding bird life because of the onshore wind park size. <strong>The land lord is demanding action to reduce noise and preserve bird life.</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Two alternative actions:</p>$q$, $q$1. Adjust turbine operation during sensitive hours. OPEX increases by $0.005 m/MW due to increased monitoring, and capacity factor decreases to 35%.$q$, null, null, null, 0.35, null, null, 0, true, null),
  ('98509310-04a4-44bd-8ba1-662faf85fa88', '95d38b90-1d15-4c16-99d3-9cfff27f4036', '7b358cb6-9eaa-42bc-beec-a844c5c02820', $q$Photon$q$, $q$2 Industrial dust$q$, 6, $q$$q$, $q$$q$, $q$2. Invest in anti-soiling coatings to reduce negative effect of industrial dust on energy output. Add a CAPEX of $0.03 MUSD/MW. Increases OPEX to $0.035 MUSD/MW. CF will increase with 5% after 1 year.$q$, null, null, null, 0.28, null, null, 0, true, null),
  ('e615d3f8-4bea-45a7-9f90-ac702436289e', '95d38b90-1d15-4c16-99d3-9cfff27f4036', 'b974d6d4-341c-4e38-bd4e-db03bbbb0ef5', $q$Helios$q$, $q$2 Curtailment issues$q$, 6, $q$$q$, $q$$q$, $q$2. Invest in new battery storage solution technology. Adds a CAPEX of $0.3 m/MW. Increases OPEX with $0.03 m/MW. Capacity factor will be restored to 28% after 1 year.$q$, null, null, null, null, null, null, 0, true, null),
  ('a16f0eb4-40a1-4354-994f-c22422a83cde', '95d38b90-1d15-4c16-99d3-9cfff27f4036', 'aa22815f-f492-40cb-8cca-0639f02a3791', $q$Nova$q$, $q$1Unfavourable weather conditions$q$, 6, $q$Nova Solar - Unfavourable weather conditions$q$, $q$<p>The Nova Solar farm is experiencing decreased sunlight hours due to climate change-induced cloud cover. The project has lower energy output than anticipated and immediate action is needed to deliver promised electricity.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Capacity factor has been reduced by 5%.</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Two alternative actions:</p>$q$, $q$1. Diversify with wind energy by investing in wind project. Go to the portfolio simulator to acquire new prospect.$q$, null, null, null, 0.23, null, null, 0, true, null),
