  ('8cc9d916-4cd0-4823-b482-db81a68698eb', '95d38b90-1d15-4c16-99d3-9cfff27f4036', 'd6376c30-1d8f-48a1-b26e-0b88f4229d48', $q$Pandora$q$, $q$1Y8_Pandora_export_Nostro_fluid_issue-Pandora$q$, 7, $q$PANDORA - Issue with fluid composition$q$, $q$<p>There is a mis-match between fluid properties, specifically level of mercury. The fluid specification cannot be matched with existing stream from Fresco.</p><p><br></p><p>This has extensive impact of design basis, two alternatives:</p>$q$, $q$1. Accept a delay of 2 years and additional 120 MUSD in CAPEX.$q$, null, null, null, null, null, null, 0, true, $q$41ca5ea8-d001-4e83-9450-e84b403cebc2$q$),
  ('4e41c68c-718f-4b1d-8a64-7c69b9a4ac3a', '95d38b90-1d15-4c16-99d3-9cfff27f4036', 'd6376c30-1d8f-48a1-b26e-0b88f4229d48', $q$Pandora$q$, $q$2Y8_pandora export -Pandora$q$, 7, $q$$q$, $q$$q$, $q$2. Spend 340 MUSD in CAPEX for accelerated rebuild.$q$, null, true, null, null, null, null, 0, true, $q$41ca5ea8-d001-4e83-9450-e84b403cebc2$q$),
