  ('fe2e8ecc-1d1e-4c95-9c6d-307dc47cb916', '95d38b90-1d15-4c16-99d3-9cfff27f4036', 'd907cb7f-35e6-4a92-a08f-468750e112de', $q$Fresco$q$, $q$1 Electrification-Fresco$q$, 8, $q$FRESCO - Electrification$q$, $q$<p>The increase in CO2 taxes and the "Electrification Law on Fossil Fuels Producers" has prompted an immediate action for asset owners to electrify AND develop renewable energy compensating the energy needed for the asset.</p><p><br></p><p>Electricity shall replace gas turbines, and the need at Fresco is 252 Gwh per year. The project CAPEX is 270 MUSD divided over 3 years.</p><p><br></p><p>In addition, you must compensate your electricity consumption by building new renewable capacity. The capacity needed is 36 MW, or more if capacity factor is less than 100%. Needed capacity = 36 MW/CF%.</p><p><br></p><p>You CANNOT procure an already producing asset. Failure to comply will result in an additional 150% CO₂ tax. Please decide on:</p>$q$, $q$1. Electrify and invest in renewables – We have identified or invested in a renewable project to offset electricity consumption.$q$, null, true, null, null, null, null, 0, true, null),
  ('90abb493-b8e3-46c0-a02c-8a5641d16356', '95d38b90-1d15-4c16-99d3-9cfff27f4036', 'd907cb7f-35e6-4a92-a08f-468750e112de', $q$Fresco$q$, $q$2Electrification No fresco-Fresco$q$, 8, $q$$q$, $q$$q$, $q$2. Do not electrify – We will continue operating as is and accept a 150% increase in CO₂ tax.$q$, null, true, null, null, null, null, 0, true, null),
